uzzles (if they like).Next Fest Ready: The demo is updated, tested, and ready for the festival starting on 19th October.Progress on Full Game: The development of the full game is progressing fast and will be ready for ini","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T11:38:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4326730-1838407329266225","game_id":"steam-4326730","kind":"announcement","title":"New graphics and artwork have arrived, just in time for the Steam Train Fest!","summary":"Hi all,Happy news: Development on The Last Night Train is progressing fast and here's a major update:Visual Upgrade: The colors and contrast of the demo have been greatly improved.Puzzle Polish: Various minor improvements have been made to the puzzles.New Artwork: The artwork and game logo have been completely redesigned.This update was completed just in time for today's launch of the Steam Train Fest — a fun event for all train lovers, like myself 🚂😊Take a look, and enjoy the festival, Nici","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T17:43:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4326730-1832065502824959","game_id":"steam-4326730","kind":"announcement","title":"Act 1 is now available as a free demo on Steam!","summary":"It's finally here: The first act of \"The Last Night Train\" is ready for you to play. The demo is about 60 minutes long, featuring puzzles that actually surprise you, a story with heart and humor, and a first boss fight that requires both brains and reflexes. An Easy Mode is available for those who prefer to 